<title>USA: Ralcorp completes purchase of Wortz Co.</title>
<headline>Ralcorp completes purchase of Wortz Co.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ralcorp Holdings Inc said Monday it completed the purchase of Wortz Co, a private-label cracker and cookie company in Poteau, Okla.</p>
<p>Wortz will be operated as part of Ralcorp's existing private-label cracker and cookie subsidiary, Bremner Inc.</p>
<p>On March 17, 1997, Ralcorp said it signed a definitive agreement to buy Wortz within 60 days pending receipt of necessary government approvals.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>	  ((Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
